### 🎨 Custom Emoji Icon Engine Standard
1. **Header Embedding**: 48×48 RGBA PNGs generated from `Noto Color Emoji` are embedded in `<Meta><CustomIcons><Icon>`.
2. **KeePassXC Priority**: To ensure custom icons display in the KeePassXC tree sidebar, every `<Group>` element MUST have `<IconID>0</IconID>` paired directly with `<CustomIconUUID>b64_uuid</CustomIconUUID>`.
3. **Stale Reference Safeguard**: When updating custom icons, all existing `<CustomIcons>` nodes in `<Meta>` and `<CustomIconUUID>` tags on groups must be cleanly purged and re-linked to prevent fallback to the default key icon.

